    {
      "text": "The Oyapock River Bridge is a cable-stayed bridge. It spans the Oyapock River to link the cities of Oiapoque in Brazil and Saint-Georges de l'Oyapock in French Guiana.",
      "category": "geography"
    },
    {
      "text": "After initial military setbacks, Ethelred was able to agree to terms with Olaf, who returned to Norway to try to gain his kingdom with mixed success.",
      "category": "politics"
    },
    {
      "text": "In the archipelagos and lakes you do not necessarily need a yacht.",
